{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d1_rename_item", "label": "D1 \u2014 Renomea\u00e7\u00e3o com Rename-Item", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Preserva arquivo, conte\u00fado e atributos e \u00e9 simples de auditar; ordem crescente evita confus\u00e3o de prefixos. Alternativas rejeitadas: git mv (proibido executar git), copiar+apagar (risco de perda), lote sem pr\u00e9-checagem (sobrescrita silenciosa)."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d2_fronteira", "label": "D2 \u2014 Fronteira entre Refer\u00eancia Textual e Conte\u00fado Normativo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sem fronteira expl\u00edcita, uma substitui\u00e7\u00e3o ampla alteraria regras ou exemplos; sem atualizar os pr\u00f3prios arquivos, sobrariam refer\u00eancias quebradas. S\u00f3 o token do nome muda."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d3_manifesto", "label": "D3 \u2014 Manifesto \u00danico de Renomea\u00e7\u00e3o e Refer\u00eancias", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sete renomea\u00e7\u00f5es e refer\u00eancias em procedimento, README, redirect e sete su\u00edtes exigem fonte \u00fanica para evitar substitui\u00e7\u00f5es divergentes e permitir revisar o escopo antes de editar."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d4_inventario", "label": "D4 \u2014 Invent\u00e1rio Nominal Fechado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Invent\u00e1rio fecha a lacuna do Plan: 55 ocorr\u00eancias no procedimento, 17 no README, 1 no redirect e 7 su\u00edtes mapeadas; specs hist\u00f3ricas, graphify-out, target e .git ficam fora do corpus."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d5_redirect", "label": "D5 \u2014 Redirect Legado Preservado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A feature 006 manteve um \u00fanico redirect na porta de entrada; renomear ou remover quebraria compatibilidade e criar redirects para os seis restantes ampliaria o escopo sem exig\u00eancia."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d7_suites", "label": "D7 \u2014 Su\u00edtes Existentes Atualizadas e Su\u00edte de Contrato Nova", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Su\u00edtes existentes leem caminhos fixos e falhariam antes da feature; a nova su\u00edte phase-aware transforma os crit\u00e9rios da spec em falha de build, seguindo o precedente das features 008/009."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d8_artefato", "label": "D8 \u2014 Artefato Empacotado: target/classes no Gate, JAR Opt-in", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O build j\u00e1 empacota src/main/resources em target/classes, que as su\u00edtes leem; o JAR instalado depende de mvn install e ambiente limpo, ent\u00e3o a verifica\u00e7\u00e3o fica opt-in e n\u00e3o \u00e9 gate de aceite."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d9_performance", "label": "D9 \u2014 Guarda de Regress\u00e3o de 10% (Feature 007)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Renomear arquivos n\u00e3o deve alterar o tempo de build de forma relevante; o or\u00e7amento existente \u00e9 usado apenas como guarda, nunca como crit\u00e9rio de aceite."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d11_divisao_fases", "label": "D11 \u2014 Divis\u00e3o entre as Fases", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A subpasta 01 \u00e9 o gateway de leitura e pode ser demonstrada isoladamente; a Fase 2 depende da Fase 1 apenas para a confer\u00eancia final de zero nomes antigos."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_d12_nomes_exatos", "label": "D12 \u2014 Nomes Exatos, Ap\u00f3strofo e Sistema de Arquivos", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O ap\u00f3strofo em 00-entry-point' \u00e9 pontua\u00e7\u00e3o da demanda; nomes s\u00e3o aplicados exatamente, com pr\u00e9-checagem que aborta a subpasta em caso de colis\u00e3o."}, {"id": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_files_research_inventario_consolidado", "label": "Invent\u00e1rio Consolidado de Refer\u00eancias", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/010-rename-procedure-entry-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_010_rename_procedure_entry_file